# Local symlinks created by slice fix-orphan-shared-directories
# (2026-07-14, PR #73..#79 chain). Each `libs/features/<x>/server/shared`
# symlink points to `libs/features/<x>/shared` to repair import resolution
# without modifying the canonical package boundaries. These symlinks are
# machine-local (different absolute paths on different clones would break
# them) and must NOT be tracked. They are recreated on demand by the
# slice's installer if missing.
**/server/shared